1
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:45,420
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:47,100
[Episode 10]

3
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:47,500
[Adapted from Migu's novel
"Unsoiled Starlight"]

4
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,880
Here you go.

6
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,560
Enjoy your meal.

7
00:00:57,920 --> 00:01:01,240
You two were
in the Qining High School, right?

8
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:02,640
Yes.

9
00:01:03,950 --> 00:01:05,200
It's you!

10
00:01:06,170 --> 00:01:07,320
No wonder.

11
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:08,880
If I had known it was you,

12
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:10,400
I would have given this young lady

13
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,600
an extra fried egg.

14
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:14,280
What do you mean?

15
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:16,080
Young lady, you didn't know?

16
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:17,200
When you used to come here

17
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,920
to eat by yourself,

18
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:19,920
this young man

19
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:22,000
would always secretly follow behind you.

20
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,100
He wouldn't say anything,

21
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:24,300
just stand over there

22
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:25,280
and watch you.

23
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:26,920
Then he would give me money

24
00:01:26,940 --> 00:01:28,740
to add an extra fried egg for you.

25
00:01:29,730 --> 00:01:32,390
It's so nice
that you young people are together.

26
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:33,729
Are you married?

27
00:01:37,090 --> 00:01:38,200
Not yet.

28
00:01:39,250 --> 00:01:40,280
It'll be soon.

29
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:46,650
So you were the one
who added that fried egg for me.

30
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,960
I always thought

31
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:49,880
everyone had two in their bowls.

32
00:01:56,210 --> 00:01:57,200
Well,

33
00:01:57,890 --> 00:01:58,800
I'm sorry.

34
00:02:00,510 --> 00:02:01,840
Why the sudden apology?

35
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:04,700
Is it because of this?

36
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,680
Not just because of this.

37
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:09,039
I lost my temper with you that night.

38
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,250
At that time,

39
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,720
some bad things occured

40
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:15,080
and I couldn't control my emotions.

41
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,160
So,

42
00:02:16,890 --> 00:02:18,079
I took it out on you.

43
00:02:24,140 --> 00:02:25,240
Ms. Shu Tinglan,

44
00:02:25,890 --> 00:02:27,720
I formally accept your apology.

45
00:02:32,270 --> 00:02:32,970
This gesture

46
00:02:32,970 --> 00:02:33,920
and this look...

47
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,500
Every time you make them in a meeting,

48
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:36,600
we know we're going to get scolded.

49
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:38,860
Maybe you should do that less from now on.

50
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:43,920
Although

51
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,600
something dangerous happened,

52
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,040
I finally made it back to Qining,

53
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,160
cheering me up a lot.

54
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,760
You're not even from Qining.

55
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,480
You just went to high school here
for three years.

56
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,880
Was it really that great?

57
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,440
Those three years

58
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,120
mean a lot

59
00:02:59,690 --> 00:03:00,640
to me.

60
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:02,320
Okay.

61
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:05,420
You nod, but did you even understand?

62
00:03:09,510 --> 00:03:10,400
Yes.

63
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:14,600
Heartless.

64
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,440
Shu Tinglan,

65
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,400
can I pursue you?

66
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,120
I was just thinking,

67
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,320
if only in high school

68
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:40,920
I had the courage

69
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,329
to sit here
and confess my feelings to you.

70
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,300
During those three years,

71
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:47,540
every time I came to this noodle shop,

72
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,860
I wanted to sit here

73
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:49,980
and say this to you.

74
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,360
Is it too late for me to say it now?

75
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,560
It's okay.

76
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,690
You don't have to answer me right away.

77
00:04:21,350 --> 00:04:24,460
[Zhuoyuan Technology's New Product Launch]

78
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,120
At this launch event,

79
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,440
Zhuoyuan Technology

80
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:32,440
will launch

81
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,920
a smart system for all life scenarios,

82
00:04:34,630 --> 00:04:36,860
[Zhuoyuan Technology's New Product Launch]

83
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,960
the Lingxi series of products.

84
00:04:47,150 --> 00:04:47,310
[Performance Boost]

85
00:04:47,370 --> 00:04:47,460
[Zhuoyuan Technology's New Product Launch]

86
00:04:47,470 --> 00:04:50,659
[AI Smart Calling + Real-Time Interaction]

87
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:52,080
We have realized real-time interaction
in AI smart calling.

88
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:55,280
In this chip system,

89
00:04:54,430 --> 00:04:54,640
[AI Smart Calling + Real-Time Interaction]

90
00:04:54,659 --> 00:04:56,610
[Boundless Vision —
Redefining the Home Visual Experience]

91
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,560
we also defined

92
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,760
"Boundless Vision".

93
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:09,080
With low-latency gaming mode,

94
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:11,480
audio-visual sync
and enhanced performance,

95
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,740
we redefine the home visual experience.

96
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,560
Next is the Q&A session,

97
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:18,480
which will be conducted by me
and CTO Wen Jian

98
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,360
together.

99
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:25,130
[Boundless Vision —
Redefining the Home Visual Experience]

100
00:05:51,840 --> 00:05:52,600
Hey, Nannan.

101
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:53,880
Shushu.

102
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,360
I just watched Zhuoyuan Technology's

103
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,440
new product launch.

104
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,400
This man is so charming.

105
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:01,040
-We have to hurry. The reporter's Q&A is about to begin.
-Did you seize the chance?

106
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,040
Ms. Wen and Mr. Zhuo,

107
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,560
the golden couple of the tech world,

108
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,950
are definitely worth a report.

109
00:06:04,950 --> 00:06:05,290
Yes.

110
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,920
I'll think about it.

111
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,220
It's New Year's Eve again.

112
00:06:16,220 --> 00:06:19,520
I believe everyone is busy preparing for
the New Year's Eve dinner.

113
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:20,640
So many dishes.

114
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,920
Did you make them, or...?

115
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,720
I bought them from a restaurant.

116
00:06:24,140 --> 00:06:25,940
You know I'm not good at cooking.

117
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:29,680
It's a pity Mom can't cook now.

118
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:32,500
Otherwise, how could you possibly
be so skinny.

119
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,850
When you get better,

120
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:36,480
I'll make you cook for me every day.

121
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,409
Five meals a day,

122
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,950
until you don't want to cook anymore.

123
00:06:38,950 --> 00:06:39,840
Okay.

124
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,040
Eat more.

125
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:42,710
You eat more, too.

126
00:06:42,710 --> 00:06:43,270
Okay.

127
00:07:22,950 --> 00:07:25,060
The doctor said your condition
is much better.

128
00:07:25,060 --> 00:07:26,880
We'll move back home soon.

129
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:28,120
Okay.

130
00:07:29,870 --> 00:07:30,200
Mom,

131
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,600
can you see who it is?

132
00:07:31,620 --> 00:07:33,000
My phone is in my pocket.

133
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,590
[Zhuo Yu'an]

134
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:40,120
Zhuo.

135
00:07:40,180 --> 00:07:41,110
It's a work call.

136
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:41,940
I'll take it.

137
00:07:41,940 --> 00:07:42,480
You go ahead and eat.

138
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,040
Okay.

139
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:52,040
Hello?

140
00:07:52,540 --> 00:07:53,400
Are you at home?

141
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:55,040
No.

142
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:56,790
I'm at the hospital with my mom.

143
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:57,720
I guessed so.

144
00:07:58,360 --> 00:07:59,470
I made New Year's Eve dinner.

145
00:07:59,470 --> 00:08:00,920
Can I bring it over?

146
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:03,440
That would impose too much on you.

147
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:05,200
It's very far from downtown.

148
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,880
No big deal.

149
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:07,850
Turn around.

150
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:20,700
Happy New Year.

151
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,180
Happy New Year.

152
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:23,560
Thank you.

153
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:30,080
I should have gone in to see your mother,

154
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,360
but...

155
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:36,650
I'll get going then.

156
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:37,640
OK.

157
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:40,049
Since you're already here,

158
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,679
come in and have
New Year's Eve dinner with us.

159
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:43,480
Mom.

160
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:47,720
Thank you, ma'am.

161
00:08:52,260 --> 00:08:52,670
[Ward 514]

162
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:54,200
Thank you.

163
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:55,600
Zhuo,

164
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:56,920
have some fish.

165
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,090
He doesn't eat fish.

166
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:01,480
Mom,

167
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:02,490
here, have some.

168
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:04,260
You eat, too.

169
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:05,840
Ma'am,

170
00:09:05,900 --> 00:09:07,300
I'm a bit of a picky eater.

171
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,120
Please don't mind.

172
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:08,880
Not at all.

173
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,720
Where are you from, Zhuo?

174
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,780
I'm from Beicheng.

175
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:12,560
Coincidentally,

176
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:14,650
-Tinglan and I are...
-...in the same company.

177
00:09:14,650 --> 00:09:15,720
He's my client.

178
00:09:17,020 --> 00:09:17,960
Mom, eat more.

179
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:18,760
Eat more.

180
00:09:23,580 --> 00:09:26,200
Why aren't you with your family
for the New Year?

181
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:26,800
I...

182
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,840
My parents were abroad when I was young,

183
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,680
so I seldom eat with my family.

184
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:33,800
Do you have a girlfriend?

185
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:34,560
Mom!

186
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,240
I'm still waiting for her reply.

187
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,440
Ah.

188
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,400
Tinglan, eat.

189
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:51,080
After dinner,

190
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:53,520
you young people go out and have fun.

191
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:54,600
As for me,

192
00:09:54,640 --> 00:09:55,800
it's time to rest.

193
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:57,120
Don't worry about me.

194
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:06,080
Try this.

195
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:13,960
Thank you.

196
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,840
What are you thanking me for?

197
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:19,240
Thank you for coming over
to have New Year's Eve dinner with my mom.

198
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,160
She hasn't been

199
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:21,890
so happy for a long time.

200
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:26,060
I should be the one
thanking you and your mom.

201
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:30,690
I haven't had
a New Year's Eve dinner in years.

202
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:32,640
Let's go.

203
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:34,720
By your mom's decree,

204
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:36,480
I'm taking you out to have fun.

205
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,540
Where are we going?

206
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,980
You'll know when we get there.

207
00:10:55,160 --> 00:10:55,960
Your place.

208
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,880
May I hold your hand?

209
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:02,600
I've never seen you

210
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:03,720
so polite before.

211
00:11:05,400 --> 00:11:06,040
My bad.

212
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:18,040
I'm not sure it's a good idea.

213
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:19,370
I don't live here often.

214
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:21,320
You can come often if you want.

215
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:52,920
Can I

216
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:55,880
hug you?

217
00:11:58,640 --> 00:11:59,720
Are you planning

218
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,920
to ask for my permission

219
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:02,380
for every move from now on?

220
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,320
No.

221
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:07,340
It's just that I don't have immunity.

222
00:12:09,690 --> 00:12:10,960
During the New Year holiday,

223
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,220
you can have immunity.

224
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:20,920
How about I give this house to you?

225
00:12:21,770 --> 00:12:23,830
You can decorate it however you like.

226
00:12:24,400 --> 00:12:25,000
No.

227
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:26,920
I have my own home.

228
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,250
I still have to work.

229
00:12:28,340 --> 00:12:29,440
I don't have the energy for it.

230
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:31,570
But it's very close to your workplace.

231
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:34,410
It would be very convenient
for your commute.

232
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:34,960
What?

233
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:36,880
Do you want to keep me as a pet?

234
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,200
Can I?

235
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:39,040
No.

236
00:12:43,450 --> 00:12:44,160
Tinglan.

237
00:12:46,330 --> 00:12:47,280
May I kiss you?

238
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:51,840
I've said that

239
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,880
during the New Year holiday,

240
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:55,120
you have immunity.

241
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:57,720
You don't need to ask for my permission.

242
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:23,600
Happy New Year.

243
00:13:24,340 --> 00:13:25,440
Happy New Year.

244
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:34,600
Let's go to Huishan to watch the sunrise.
